# Workflow Rules (V2)

Canonical workflow: `AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/config/workflow-policy.json`. Project memory: `.memory/` (not full AGENTS.md on every turn).

## Protected Changes

Classifier: `.cursor/config/protected-paths.json`. Fail closed only for protected paths.

- Plan artifact required: `docs/plans/**` or `docs/adr/**`
- Review artifact required: `docs/reviews/**`
- Override: `.cursor/hooks/review-override.sh --skip-review "reason"`

## Hooks

- `preToolUse` — worker path scopes from `worker-scopes.json`
- `stop` — blocks protected changes without current plan/review
- Session start — use context-builder, not legacy skill-loader alone

## Artifacts

| Type | Path |
|---|---|
| Plans | `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-feature.md` (compact: ≤500 tokens body) |
| ADRs | `docs/adr/NNNN-title.md` |
| Reviews | `docs/reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-desc.md` (audit only — not injected as context) |
| Patterns | `.cursor/patterns/` (Tier 3 — injected when triggered) |
| Handoffs | `.cursor/context/handoffs/*.json` |

## Compact Plan Format

```markdown
# Feature Name
**Goal:** one sentence | **Protected:** yes/no | **Agents:** a, b

## Constraints
(from .memory/constraints.md — do not duplicate AGENTS.md)

## Files
| Path | Action | Owner |

## Execution
1. agent: step

## Risks
- ...
```
